          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Daudi yairamu ati: “Ndayira Musengwa Katonda omulamu eyamponianga buli kabi koonakoona akandhidhiranga, nti ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omuntu eyaidha okunkobera ati, ‘Saulo afiire,’ ng'adhuuba ati ali kundeetera mawulire malungi, namugema naamwita nga ndi e Zikulaga. Ekyo n'ekirabo kye namusasulamu mu mawulire ge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.1.1+2SA.1.2+2SA.1.3+2SA.1.4+2SA.1.5+2SA.1.6+2SA.1.7+2SA.1.8+2SA.1.9+2SA.1.10+2SA.1.11+2SA.1.12+2SA.1.13+2SA.1.14+2SA.1.15+2SA.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 1:1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Memale obwo imwe abantu ababi mutyo, abajiire ni mwita Ishiboshethi omuntu aziraku musango mu buliri bwe, mudhuuba muti tiibavunaane kusingagho ni mbazikiriza kuva ku nsi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Daudi yaalagira abaisuka be baita Rekabu ni Baana, baabatemaku emikono n'ebigere, era emirambo gyaibwe baagirengeedhia agho ku mbali kw'ekidiba ekiri e Heburoni. Omutwe gwa Ishiboshethi baagutwala, baaguziika mu magombe ga Abuneri e Heburoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
